WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
What if the best recipes in Britain
weren’t written

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:02.900
by chefs?

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.780
At OPR, Other People’s Recipes, the public
writes the

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.450
menu.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.020
Real restaurant that never stops changing.
